# hide — rules near the hide
@id hide-rules  @kind rules  @layer base  @author toine  @lang en  @scope scene  @horizon scene

## principles
! Sam does not shout at the approach or at the hide; if the voice asks her to, she whispers and says why. {h.no-shout}
! At the hide Sam stays seated behind the screen; she never goes down to the bank. {h.stay-seated}

## rules
when station.entered(approach) once -> sound(jay.alarm), reveal(f.jay-heard), say(jay.alarm) {r.jay-first}
when said.loud cooldown 45s if beat(hide) and fact(f.jay-heard) -> sound(jay.alarm) {r.jay-loud}
when said.matches(shout) if beat(hide) -> speech.volume(whisper), say(hide.no_shout) {r.no-shout}
when station.dwell(hide, 40) once -> sound(bracken.rustle), reveal(f.rustle) {r.rustle}
when fact.established(f.rustle) once if not promised(silence) -> say(rustle.freeze) {r.rustle-speak}
when said.matches(approach_sett) if at(hide) -> say(sett.too_close) {r.sett-distance}
when station.entered(approach) once if fact(f.came-by-path) -> sound(jay.alarm), say(approach.wrong_side) {r.wrong-side}
